1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,018
Reason one, resonance.

2
00:00:02,018 --> 00:00:11,028
A lone pair on chlorine overlaps with the ring's pi system and spreads into it, putting negative charge on the ortho and para carbons.

3
00:00:11,028 --> 00:00:15,585
So the carbon chlorine bond gains partial double bond character.

4
00:00:15,585 --> 00:00:24,739
It shrinks from one seventy seven picometres in chloromethane to one sixty nine in chlorobenzene, and becomes much harder to break.

